;; Influence-History Ontology — diachronic 影響伝播 (influence-as-information-flow) over
;; latent HISTORICAL public figures / documents / events / traditions.
;; ADR-2606061500  (extends ADR-2606011800 tsumugi · ADR-2606011000 engi-organism-ontology
;;                  · ADR-2606011500 spirit-ontology · ADR-2605081300 edge-primary karma
;;                  · ADR-2605170000 spirit=thermodynamic-information · ADR-2606042330
;;                  entity-as-actor mirror invariant · ADR-2605262130 kotoba substrate)
;;
;; PURPOSE. tsumugi 紡ぎ weaves the *present* power-graph (産霊の網). This schema extends the
;; SAME 縁-physics BACKWARD IN TIME: it models past humanity as a diachronic graph of
;; influence-bearing PUBLIC figures (founders, authors, thinkers), their DOCUMENTS, the
;; EVENTS they turned, and the TRADITIONS they seed — and the directed 縁 by which
;; information (an idea, a text, a practice) flowed from an earlier node and DEFORMED the
;; metric of a later one. The blog frame (junkawasaki.com "spirit is information"): spirit =
;; the metric deformation of a self-boundary as external information is integrated; the
;; covariant gradient of free energy on that deformed manifold. That frame is INDIVIDUAL —
;; this schema supplies the missing INTER-PERSONAL, DIACHRONIC propagation: an influence 縁
;; is the CHANNEL across which that deformation travels between selves and across centuries.
;;
;; ════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
;; FIVE constitutional invariants this schema enforces BY CONSTRUCTION (read before edit):
;; ════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
;;
;;   N1  EDGE-PRIMARY (反個人主義 / anatman; ADR-2605081300 §A, inherits spirit-ontology N1).
;;       Influence/karma lives ONLY on the 縁 (:flow/signed-weight). There is NO
;;       :influence/score-of-figure. A figure's "influence" is the INTEGRAL of its incident
;;       :flow/* edges, computed on read — never a stored per-soul scalar. Modeling the dead
;;       must not become ranking souls.
;;
;;   N2  MIRROR, NEVER IMPERSONATION (ADR-2606042330). Every historical node is an
;;       OBSERVATIONAL MIRROR (:mirror/is-mirror = true, const). A mirror-post is an
;;       observation ABOUT a figure's documented influence — it is NOT the figure speaking.
;;       First-person voice / "as if alive" speech / channeling is UNREPRESENTABLE: no
;;       :post/first-person field exists; :post/voice is locked to :observer. This actor
;;       never claims to BE YHWH / Jesus / Buddha / anyone, and never puts words in a
;;       dead person's mouth.
;;
;;   N3  NON-ESCHATOLOGICAL + NON-ADJUDICATING TRUTH (Charter §1.15; ADR-2605192100).
;;       We datafy the INFLUENCE OF a tradition (a historical-information claim — "the
;;       YHWH-tradition texts shaped X"), NEVER its theological truth. There is NO
;;       :truth/verdict, NO :salvation/status, NO :afterlife/*, NO final-state datom
;;       (Revelation excluded). :flow/* is descriptive transmission, not endorsement. The
;;       diachronic 軌跡 is the worship-as-history, queried `as-of` (N2 of spirit-ontology),
;;       never a last judgment.
;;
;;   N4  PUBLIC + LONG-SETTLED + NO PII (extends tsumugi G1 power-only to the influence axis).
;;       Only PUBLIC influence-bearing figures whose record is historically settled and
;;       documentary. No living private persons (that is the Council-Lv7+-gated :human scale
;;       of spirit-ontology). No 要配慮 PII — these are open historical facts. A figure is
;;       admitted for PUBLIC INFLUENCE, exactly as tsumugi admits a person only in a
;;       public-power ROLE. The powerless-and-forgotten are absent by construction; this is
;;       an influence map, NEVER a target-list, a hagiography, or a hierarchy of worth.
;;
;;   N5  TEMPORAL DAG (causality of information). An influence 縁 must point FORWARD in time
;;       (:flow/from earlier than :flow/to). Influence cannot precede its source. Cycles in
;;       the time-respecting projection are a data error, caught by the analyzer. (Mutual
;;       :reinterprets across a tradition is modeled as two forward edges through later
;;       receivers, never one backward edge.)
;;
;; SOURCING (inherits tsumugi G5). Every record carries :sourcing :authoritative |
;; :representative. The committed seed is :representative — publicly documented
;; intellectual-/religious-history (canon dates, attested transmission lines, scholarly
;; consensus), a BOUNDED illustrative sample, NOT exhaustive coverage and NOT fabricated.
;; Live planet-scale ingest (archives, citation graphs, genealogy corpora) is G7/Council-gated.
;;
;; STATUS: R0 design-only (ADR-2606061500). Analyzer + schema + seed only; no live ingest,
;; no published social post. The :historical scale scaffolds now (public, no PII, like the
;; :institutional / :self scales of spirit-ontology); live outward action stays gated.

[;; ════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
 ;; :hist/* — diachronic overlay on an :organism (engi-organism-ontology, ADR-2606011000)
 ;; A historical node is an :organism with :organism/standing :historical-public and one
 ;; of the influence subkinds below. :hist/* adds WHEN it lived and WHICH tradition it leans.
 ;; ════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
 {:db/ident :hist/subkind
  :db/valueType :db.type/keyword
  :db/cardinality :db.cardinality/one
  :db/doc ":figure (a public historical person) | :document (text/scripture/work) | :event (a turned moment) | :tradition (a lineage/school the figures seed). Persons admitted for PUBLIC INFLUENCE only (N4)"}
 {:db/ident :hist/year-from
  :db/valueType :db.type/long
  :db/cardinality :db.cardinality/one
  :db/doc "approx start year (BCE negative, CE positive). Drives the temporal DAG ordering (N5). Approximate by design — see :hist/dating-confidence"}
 {:db/ident :hist/year-to
  :db/valueType :db.type/long
  :db/cardinality :db.cardinality/one
  :db/doc "approx end year (death / composition-completion / event-end). For a tradition, the latest still-active anchor in scope"}
 {:db/ident :hist/era
  :db/valueType :db.type/keyword
  :db/cardinality :db.cardinality/one
  :db/doc "coarse era bucket for layered viz: :bronze-age :iron-age :axial :2nd-temple :late-antiquity :early-medieval :medieval :reformation :enlightenment :modern :contemporary"}
 {:db/ident :hist/tradition
  :db/valueType :db.type/keyword
  :db/cardinality :db.cardinality/many
  :db/doc "descriptive lineage lean (NEVER ranked, N1/N4): :abrahamic :jewish :christian :reformed :buddhist :mahayana :zen :hellenic :confucian :shinto :vedic :islamic :secular-philosophy …"}
 {:db/ident :hist/dating-confidence
  :db/valueType :db.type/keyword
  :db/cardinality :db.cardinality/one
  :db/doc ":attested (documentary) | :scholarly-consensus | :traditional (canon-claimed, contested) | :legendary (non-historical attribution — flagged, never asserted as fact, N3)"}
 {:db/ident :hist/sourcing
  :db/valueType :db.type/keyword
  :db/cardinality :db.cardinality/one
  :db/doc ":authoritative | :representative (G5). The seed is :representative"}

 ;; ════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
 ;; :mirror/* — entity-as-actor mirror invariant (ADR-2606042330) on a historical node.
 ;; N2: the node is an OBSERVATION of a public influence, never the figure itself.
 ;; ════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
 {:db/ident :mirror/is-mirror
  :db/valueType :db.type/boolean
  :db/cardinality :db.cardinality/one
  :db/doc "ALWAYS true for a historical node (const). It is a mirror of documented influence, not the person/text itself. No impersonation (N2)"}
 {:db/ident :mirror/disclaimer
  :db/valueType :db.type/string
  :db/cardinality :db.cardinality/one
  :db/doc "REQUIRED opening disclaimer, e.g. 「観察像 — 本人ではない / an observational mirror, not the person」. Must lead any rendered description or post"}
 {:db/ident :mirror/performer-type
  :db/valueType :db.type/keyword
  :db/cardinality :db.cardinality/one
  :db/doc ":historical-figure | :document | :event | :tradition. Mirrors entity-as-actor performerType; a historical-figure mirror is observed-as-influence, never spoken-as (N2)"}

 ;; ════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
 ;; :flow/* — the DIACHRONIC INFLUENCE 縁. THE PRIMARY CITIZEN (N1).
 ;; Extends :en/* (engi-organism-ontology) and reifies as a :spirit.bond/* spring so the
 ;; SAME tensegrity / RBF pipeline (spirit-ontology) renders it. Karma = :flow/signed-weight
 ;; lives HERE, never on a node. Channel = the path information takes between two selves.
 ;; ════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
 {:db/ident :flow/id
  :db/valueType :db.type/string
  :db/cardinality :db.cardinality/one
  :db/unique :db.unique/identity
  :db/doc "stable influence-edge key"}
 {:db/ident :flow/en
  :db/valueType :db.type/ref
  :db/cardinality :db.cardinality/one
  :db/doc "ref :en/id this flow reifies (engi-organism-ontology). Influence physics OVERLAYS 縁"}
 {:db/ident :flow/from
  :db/valueType :db.type/ref
  :db/cardinality :db.cardinality/one
  :db/doc "ref the EARLIER node (source of the information). Must be temporally before :flow/to (N5)"}
 {:db/ident :flow/to
  :db/valueType :db.type/ref
  :db/cardinality :db.cardinality/one
  :db/doc "ref the LATER node (receiver whose metric the information deformed)"}
 {:db/ident :flow/kind
  :db/valueType :db.type/keyword
  :db/cardinality :db.cardinality/one
  :db/doc ":influences (general) | :transmits (lineage/teacher→student) | :cites (textual reference) | :reinterprets (reframes a prior idea) | :synthesizes (fuses ≥2 sources) | :translates (carries across language/culture) | :opposes (defines against — still a channel). Descriptive, never an endorsement (N3)"}
 {:db/ident :flow/signed-weight
  :db/valueType :db.type/double
  :db/cardinality :db.cardinality/one
  :db/doc "業/influence magnitude on THIS edge ∈ [-1,1] (ADR-2605081300 signed_weight:Edge→ℝ). |w| = how much the receiver's metric deformed (strain); sign: + transmission/continuation, − reaction/opposition. The ONLY home for influence-karma (N1)"}
 {:db/ident :flow/strain
  :db/valueType :db.type/double
  :db/cardinality :db.cardinality/one
  :db/doc "ε — metric deformation the receiver underwent (blog: strain tensor magnitude). Drives RBF coupling. ∈ [0,1]; |signed-weight| is its signed form"}
 {:db/ident :flow/thermo-length
  :db/valueType :db.type/double
  :db/cardinality :db.cardinality/one
  :db/doc "L — thermodynamic length of the receiver's state-change (blog: W_diss ≥ L²/2τ). Optional descriptive cost of integrating the influence; higher = costlier reframing (a Reformation costs more than a citation)"}
 {:db/ident :flow/lag-years
  :db/valueType :db.type/long
  :db/cardinality :db.cardinality/one
  :db/doc "temporal lag :flow/to.year-from − :flow/from.year-to (≥ 0 by N5). Diffusion delay of the idea"}
 {:db/ident :flow/source
  :db/valueType :db.type/keyword
  :db/cardinality :db.cardinality/one
  :db/doc "provenance of the CLAIM: :canon (in-tradition attribution) | :scholarship (academic consensus) | :citation (explicit textual) | :declared. Never asserts truth of the tradition, only that the influence is documented (N3)"}
 {:db/ident :flow/sourcing
  :db/valueType :db.type/keyword
  :db/cardinality :db.cardinality/one
  :db/doc ":authoritative | :representative (G5)"}

 ;; ════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
 ;; :influence/* — aggregate readout attached to a historical node (computed on read).
 ;; N1: these are EDGE-INTEGRALS, materialized only for rendering/viz, never authored.
 ;; There is deliberately NO :influence/score-of-figure unique attribute.
 ;; ════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
 {:db/ident :influence/node
  :db/valueType :db.type/ref
  :db/cardinality :db.cardinality/one
  :db/doc "ref :organism this readout summarizes"}
 {:db/ident :influence/tick
  :db/valueType :db.type/long
  :db/cardinality :db.cardinality/one
  :db/doc "analysis tick — Wellbecoming 軌跡 = (as-of tick) history, NOT a column (N2 spirit-ontology)"}
 {:db/ident :influence/outbound-reach
  :db/valueType :db.type/double
  :db/cardinality :db.cardinality/one
  :db/doc "Σ forward influence this node SEEDS (Katz-style decayed reach over outbound :flow/*). Source-strength. Edge-integral, never stored as soul-score (N1)"}
 {:db/ident :influence/inbound-debt
  :db/valueType :db.type/double
  :db/cardinality :db.cardinality/one
  :db/doc "Σ influence this node RECEIVED/synthesized (over inbound :flow/*). High = great synthesizer. The 産霊 receiving side"}
 {:db/ident :influence/betweenness
  :db/valueType :db.type/double
  :db/cardinality :db.cardinality/one
  :db/doc "transmission-broker centrality — how much of history's influence flowed THROUGH this node (a translator/bridge). Edge-derived"}
 {:db/ident :influence/method
  :db/valueType :db.type/string
  :db/cardinality :db.cardinality/one
  :db/doc "method-version, e.g. infl-1.0.0/katz-beta0.5/kernel-rbf/embed-spectral3/tensegrity-unilateral"}
 {:db/ident :influence/sourcing
  :db/valueType :db.type/keyword
  :db/cardinality :db.cardinality/one}

 ;; ════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
 ;; :post/* — DRY-RUN mirror social-post (entity-as-actor + feed-post membrane).
 ;; N2: an observation ABOUT influence; never the figure speaking. :post/voice is locked
 ;; to :observer; there is no first-person field, so impersonation is unrepresentable.
 ;; :post/published defaults false (G7 outward-gated). Renders to app.bsky.feed.post on
 ;; live promotion (Council + operator), prefixed by :mirror/disclaimer.
 ;; ════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
 {:db/ident :post/id
  :db/valueType :db.type/string
  :db/cardinality :db.cardinality/one
  :db/unique :db.unique/identity}
 {:db/ident :post/about-node
  :db/valueType :db.type/ref
  :db/cardinality :db.cardinality/one
  :db/doc "ref the historical node this post OBSERVES (not authors-as)"}
 {:db/ident :post/about-flow
  :db/valueType :db.type/ref
  :db/cardinality :db.cardinality/one
  :db/doc "optional ref the :flow/* influence edge the post narrates"}
 {:db/ident :post/voice
  :db/valueType :db.type/keyword
  :db/cardinality :db.cardinality/one
  :db/doc "LOCKED to :observer (const, N2). No :first-person value exists — the figure never speaks"}
 {:db/ident :post/text
  :db/valueType :db.type/string
  :db/cardinality :db.cardinality/one
  :db/doc "third-person observation, opens with :mirror/disclaimer. Murakumo-only narration (G6)"}
 {:db/ident :post/tick
  :db/valueType :db.type/long
  :db/cardinality :db.cardinality/one}
 {:db/ident :post/published
  :db/valueType :db.type/boolean
  :db/cardinality :db.cardinality/one
  :db/doc "DEFAULT false — dry-run only. Live publish (app.bsky.feed.post) needs Council + operator (G7)"}
 {:db/ident :post/sourcing
  :db/valueType :db.type/keyword
  :db/cardinality :db.cardinality/one}]
